        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    weights = [0.40, 0.30, 0.30]\n    standard_deviations = [0.15, 0.20, 0.25]\n    covariance_matrix = [\n        [standard_deviations[0] ** 2, 0.02, 0.03],\n        [0.02, standard_deviations[1] ** 2, 0.04],\n        [0.03, 0.04, standard_deviations[2] ** 2],\n    ]\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    variance = sum(\n        weights[i] * weights[j] * covariance_matrix[i][j]\n        for i in range(3)\n        for j in range(3)\n    )\n    answer = round(variance ** 0.5 * 100, 2)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
